   "value": "The Northern Border Regional Commission (NBRC) is a Federal-State partnership for economic and community development in northern Maine, New Hampshire, Vermont, and New York.  Each year, the NBRC provides Federal funds for critical economic and community development projects throughout the northeast.  These investments lead to new job creation and leverage substantial private sector investments.",
